{"3429120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "우리 아빠는 용사랍니다", "steam_appid": 3429120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>My Dad Is A Hero</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;My Dad Is A Hero&quot;</strong> is a <strong>single-player action RPG story adventure</strong> where two heroes, bound by fate, face their struggles and uncover the truth of their world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Tale of Two Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the story of two extraordinary heroes.<br><strong>Mehiron</strong> lost both his father and mother at a young age, growing up with a dream of following in his father’s footsteps as a hero.<br>Meanwhile, <strong>Titan</strong>, a 7-year veteran hero and co-leader of the Intelligence Division, begins gathering information about the strange monsters that have started to appear.<br>What could be happening in their world?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mehiron:</strong> A young man who lost his parents at an early age and grew up holding onto his dream of becoming a hero like his father.<br><strong>Titan:</strong> A 7-year veteran hero and co-leader of the Intelligence Division, now investigating the sudden appearance of mysterious monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As their paths intertwine, the two protagonists uncover secrets that threaten the world.<br>What destiny awaits them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Protagonists:</strong><br>Experience the intertwined stories of Mehiron and Titan by alternating between their perspectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Epic Acts:</strong><br>Unravel hidden truths in each act as the threat to the world intensifies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Boss Fights:</strong><br>Engage in thrilling battles against powerful bosses with unique patterns and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blend of Action and Adventure:</strong><br>Enjoy fast-paced combat combined with an immersive narrative for a unique experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>My Dad Is A Hero</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;My Dad Is A Hero&quot;</strong> is a <strong>single-player action RPG story adventure</strong> where two heroes, bound by fate, face their struggles and uncover the truth of their world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Tale of Two Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the story of two extraordinary heroes.<br><strong>Mehiron</strong> lost both his father and mother at a young age, growing up with a dream of following in his father’s footsteps as a hero.<br>Meanwhile, <strong>Titan</strong>, a 7-year veteran hero and co-leader of the Intelligence Division, begins gathering information about the strange monsters that have started to appear.<br>What could be happening in their world?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mehiron:</strong> A young man who lost his parents at an early age and grew up holding onto his dream of becoming a hero like his father.<br><strong>Titan:</strong> A 7-year veteran hero and co-leader of the Intelligence Division, now investigating the sudden appearance of mysterious monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As their paths intertwine, the two protagonists uncover secrets that threaten the world.<br>What destiny awaits them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Protagonists:</strong><br>Experience the intertwined stories of Mehiron and Titan by alternating between their perspectives.</p></li><li>